Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:04.25,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}終わりが来たら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:06.50,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}なんて言おう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どうせなら　ほら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.84,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}哀しくない様に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:17.72,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかのあなたの言葉が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:20.22,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}酷く刺さってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:26.06,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:36.91,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}知れば知るだけでいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:39.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何かを求めてしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:40.45,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:42.49,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行かないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.49,0:01:44.58,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}どこにも行けないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:49.21,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}忘れないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:54.67,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何故か遠くなる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:02:01.14,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}瞳の裏にいつも君は居る
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:05.60,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}今も　ずっとそう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:08.06,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}いつかね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:09.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}もう少しね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:13.48,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}世界に優しい風が吹いたら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:17.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}何か変わるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:20.24,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}「帰りたい場所がある」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}誰もがこの星の子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.54,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}約束はね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:25.95,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}大事にね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:30.33,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:04.25,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倘若終結將降臨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:06.50,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}那該說些什麼才好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.63,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}倒不如像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.84,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}裝作不曾悲傷的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:17.72,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}往昔你說過的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.39,0:01:20.22,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}深深地刺痛著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:26.06,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}但溫暖猶存
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:36.91,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}明明知曉便已足夠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:39.07,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}卻總是渴求著更多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:40.45,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:42.49,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}我哪裡都不會去的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.49,0:01:44.58,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}其實我也無處可去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:49.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}分明從未遺忘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.29,0:01:54.67,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}卻為何漸行漸遠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:02:01.14,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}你始終存於我眼眸的深處
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.14,0:02:05.60,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}至今 一直如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:08.06,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:09.19,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}再稍等片刻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:13.48,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}如果世間吹起溫柔的風
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:17.57,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}是否會發生改變
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.57,0:02:20.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}「總有想要回去的地方」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:23.08,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}人人都是這顆星球的子孫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.54,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}而約定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:25.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}可要好好珍惜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:30.33,OPCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord2\blur2}溫暖猶存
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:21.98,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}So don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:26.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに知らないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.57,0:22:31.41,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたを守れますように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:37.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}The story has only just begun
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あてのない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.17,0:22:44.59,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}道なき道にいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:49.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}迷いながらいてもどうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:57.31,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望が　そこにあるよ　ともにあるよ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.52,0:23:00.02,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:02.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どこにいでも行ける羽を
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.07,0:23:04.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,1030)}We are…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.82,0:23:06.32,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたに授けたの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:13.28,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}どんな闇も晴らしてしまえるように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.49,0:23:17.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}You gave me holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:22.04,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}恐れず進めよ　Oh holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}振り返ればいつも　Holy trace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:30.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}あなたが笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.60,0:23:35.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}だから　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:40.14,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躓きながらでも　Holy brave
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:44.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}私は踏み出せる　遠くへ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:49.07,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}あなたがいる場所へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:21.98,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以不要擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:26.53,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願不會被你察覺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.57,0:22:31.41,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願默默守護著你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.83,0:22:37.37,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}故事才剛剛拉開序幕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.50,0:22:40.13,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}縱使是在望不到盡頭的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.17,0:22:44.59,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}舉步維艱時也請相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:49.55,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}躊躇不定時也請相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:57.31,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}希望就在那裡 與我們相伴
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.52,0:23:00.02,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:02.40,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}將能飛向萬千世界的羽翼
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.07,0:23:04.65,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2\pos(960,50)}我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.82,0:23:06.32,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}授予你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:13.28,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}願它能助你劃破一切黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.49,0:23:17.46,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}你賜予了我神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:22.04,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}讓我不懼一切地前行 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.38,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}每當回首都是條 光明之路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:30.51,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}都有你的笑容相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.60,0:23:35.64,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}所以 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:40.14,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}即便是幾經坎坷 神聖的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.14,0:23:44.52,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}我都會邁向遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:49.07,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur2}向著有你在的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:49.07,PZ,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,PZ,,0,0,0,,
